  "summary": "Parse Server before 8.6.114 and 9.0.0 before 9.10.6 Information Disclosure via Object Create Response",
  "details": "Parse Server before 8.6.114 and 9.0.0 before 9.10.6 returns field values in object create responses to callers that lack read access to the created object through class-level permissions or the object's ACL. An attacker with create permission can create objects to obtain values set by Cloud Code triggers, schema defaults, and the class default ACL.",
